<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <!--
        The empty set, ∅, for the name.

        Sized to reach about 27 from the centre of the 108 canvas. That is well inside the central
        66 every launcher is guaranteed to show, and it leaves a ring of black around the mark
        rather than crowding whatever mask the launcher happens to apply.

        The ring is two half arcs rather than one nearly-closed arc, so the stroke has no seam
        where its ends meet.
    -->
    <path
        android:pathData="M35.5,54 A18.5,18.5 0 1,1 72.5,54 A18.5,18.5 0 1,1 35.5,54"
        android:strokeColor="#FFFFFF"
        android:strokeWidth="7" />
    <!--
        The slash runs past the ring at both ends, the way the symbol is written. Flat ends, not
        round: a round cap on a stroke this thick reads as a knob stuck to the outside of the ring
        rather than as a line passing through it.
    -->
    <path
        android:pathData="M35,73 L73,35"
        android:strokeColor="#FFFFFF"
        android:strokeWidth="7" />
</vector>
